        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Fast and friendly service. Food was good and the menu had many options. Only downside was the constant draft from the entrance that had us keep our coats on throughout the meal.",
        "time": 1735482139,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Todd Collard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111612017596541552045/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnBQ0_8o2znFD2XzDNDB7f5ybJYDeN7hcSL4ELODjCin8CV98=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "We went back to this place this morning, relatively early, around 9am. We were greeted at the door and brought to a table immediately. The food was nothing short of FANTASTIC, nice presentation, wonderful flavor! Our waitress Sara was very attentive, despite being very busy. They have had issues in the past with being short staffed on the floor and in the kitchen which can obviously slow down service, but today was PERFECT! Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1759675562,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brandon M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104581712050055538618/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXo2loZtEsf8FmRiKSgjPU_h3YvMSKAiyGIpzjQcIjz_ra1Cim_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I'm not a difficult client, but I've been to multiple L'oufriers, and this has to be the worst one. Coffee is cold, and it's not even the typical Lavazza coffee they use, tasted like instant coffee. And not to mention the cup had lipstick on it.\n\nShould have gotten the hint when I walked in and it was empty on a Sunday morning. Very disappointed.\n\nAnd by the way, seats are ripped, management should take that into account.",
        "time": 1766333306,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sherry Dupuis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110997659413214534882/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwC3zy1NbRNyhktXdHh0ZWQP4Lv5co87Uro3CJ7JOmGYlLnw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Salem consistently gives wonderful service! His cheerful disposition and attention to detail adds to the enjoyment of the meal! Thanks for another beautiful experience😊",
        "time": 1743870873,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marilyne Vaccaro",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110733163534446536197/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvFymL8A1jKV_GCZOvi6-NKY49JTCwy8gszpYtbzosYZdUlxJr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The staff at this location has kept us returning as often as we can! Sarah is my son’s favourite ! She is so pleasant, efficient and overall lovely! Thank you Sarah for your amazing service! Always a pleasure to see you!",
